  "derivedWhy": {
    "secondaryTextAA": "The guide's secondary text #74847F is 3.93:1 on white and 3.65:1 on the canvas; the guide itself says to check. #5F706A is 4.86:1 on the canvas and is what small metadata text uses. #74847F stays available as --s4-secondary-text for non-text uses only.",
    "ink900..ink600, line150, line25, mutedLine": "Green-grey neutral ramp filling the gaps between the guide's text, divider and canvas colours so the existing neutral scale keeps working.",
    "tags.neutral": "Guide has no neutral tag (Scheduled / Due to send / informational). Neutral grey-green tint, 6.1:1.",
    "tags.warning": "Severity has two amber levels (advisory, warning). Advisory uses the guide's attention pair; warning is a deeper amber so the two stay distinguishable besides their label and glyph.",
    "tags.urgent": "Guide 6: strong solid colour only for urgent. Uses the critical hue solid with white text (6.48:1)."
  },
